## Endpoints

### Data Read (8)
- `GET /{id}` — Get data associated with a specific ID.
- `GET /action/0` — Retrieve data for action 0.
- `GET /cm/{cmId}/translations/en.json` — Get English translations for a content module.
- `GET /investor-database/{investor-databaseId}` — Retrieve data for a specific investor database entry.
- `GET /p/conversions/s/0.8.54-beta` — Get conversion data for a specific version.
- `GET /p/conversions/t/{tId}` — Retrieve conversion data by tId.
- `GET /pagead/conversion/{conversionId}/` — Retrieve data for a specific conversion.
- `GET /v2/rb` — Get data from the v2/rb endpoint.

### Data Write (6)
- `POST /actionp/0` — Write data to the actionp/0 endpoint.
- `POST /api/referral-attributions` — Submit referral attribution data.
- `POST /jwyz2bj1` — Write data to the jwyz2bj1 endpoint.
- `POST /p/conversions/c/l` — Write conversion data to the p/conversions/c/l endpoint.
- `POST /v1/{v1Id}` — Write data to the v1/{v1Id} endpoint.
- `POST /wa/` — Write data to the wa/ endpoint.

